trong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally combine the unique clue inventories of the two detectives to find the whole truth. Not only will it reveal the true killer - but also challenge Nur and Sage to understand each other better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881710/extras/fa2926be68714448d7bf84cdb9d7f63b.poster.avif?t=1767614398\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881710/extras/fa2926be68714448d7bf84cdb9d7f63b.webm?t=1767614398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881710/extras/fa2926be68714448d7bf84cdb9d7f63b.mp4?t=1767614398\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When beloved actor Rem J. Knox is gunned down mid-performance, all eyes turn to his co-star, Lune Clair. The culprit seems obvious but something doesn\u2019t feel right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The deeper Sage and Nur dig into the theater\u2019s shadows, the clearer it becomes: there is something unspoken hidden beneath the mountain of evidence.</p>","developers":["Lost Lantern Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881710/6daf060e033c5f12bc4e59b9191e37c3bcacdc0d/header.jpg?t=1767614398","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 (High Sierra) or more<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> integrierte GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mov