207f25ff6bd/ss_2b90b1214b0f42f097acaeb039fa5207f25ff6bd.600x338.jpg?t=1767614398"}],"short_description":"Night Errand is a 2D detective adventure where you play as Sage &amp; Nur, an unlikely detective duo solving murder and mixing coffee in the quiet town Morrowpines. Collect clues, piece together contrasting perspectives, uncover the truth \u2014 and don't forget to mix a cup of coffee while you're at it.","steam_appid":3881710,"support_info":{"email":"lostlanterns.studio@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, German, Japanese","type":"game","website":"https://www.lostlanternstudio.de/"}